02:52.000 --> 02:53.800
The seat here is available.

02:55.480 --> 02:56.440
Look at him.

02:56.520 --> 02:58.920
Why do I feel like my best friend
just kicked me away?

03:00.480 --> 03:02.320
Well, you go sit over there.

03:02.400 --> 03:03.280
Yes, ma'am.

03:04.800 --> 03:08.720
