but kicking me off the chair!

03:09.760 --> 03:11.000
You still don't get it?

03:12.040 --> 03:13.440
If she laughed,

03:14.360 --> 03:15.960
that means you went the right way.

03:17.720 --> 03:19.080
She laughed at me?

03:19.680 --> 03:20.640
Me.

03:23.120 --> 03:25.360
Hello, Nanno. I'm Lookmhee.

03:30.000 --> 03:32.200
