36:05.120 --> 36:06.640
We were just having fun.

36:07.520 --> 36:10.720
From time to time. Win-win.

36:10.800 --> 36:12.480
Win-win, right?

36:16.360 --> 36:18.240
Nanno!

36:35.640 --> 36:36.680
Petch.

36:41.400 --> 36:42.360
Petch.

36:46.880 --> 36:47.840
Nanai?

37:01.000 --> 37:02.000
Petch.

37:05.240 --> 37:06.800
I'm sorry.

37:09.160 --> 37:11.480
I'm so sorry for everything.

37:13.080 --> 37:15.240
I now understand you completely.

37:17.960 --> 37:20.080
I'm sorry for defaming you.

37:21.600 --> 37:24.360
I'm sorry for leaving you alone.

37:27.760 --> 37:29.920
I'm sorry for putting you
in this position.

37:36.600 --> 37:38.560
It's been a while.

37:43.440 --> 37:44.920
I haven't thought about it.

37:48.400 --> 37:49.800
Don't apologize to me.

37:56.040 --> 37:58.960
We were both wrong back then.

38:07.240 --> 38:08.240
One more thing.

38:10.880 --> 38:14.760
I'm okay with what I've chosen right now.

38:47.000 --> 38:48.160
Good luck, Nanai.

39:56.160 --> 39:57.320
This will hurt a bit.

39:58.120 --> 39:59.000
Be still.

40:02.680 --> 40:03.880
A little bit.

40:31.640 --> 40:32.680
Don't worry.

40:34.400 --> 40:36.400
Just a bit, you'll be awake.

41:04.480 --> 41:05.560
Hey, what's that?

41:07.440 --> 41:08.600
Your daughter.

41:11.240 --> 41:12.080
Hey.

41:12.920 --> 41:15.600
Hey, I hired you for an abortion.

41:16.080 --> 41:19.360
But my gestational age is in a few months.
How could she get out?

41:19.960 --> 41:23.000
Well, you see…
she turned out fine and healthy.

41:23.080 --> 41:25.840
That means your gestation is due.

41:25.920 --> 41:26.920
Doc.

41:29.960 --> 41:31.440
But I paid you…

41:33.880 --> 41:35.760
to kill this baby, didn't I?

41:38.520 --> 41:39.960
If you want to kill it…

41:42.080 --> 41:43.280
you have to do it yourself.

44:01.560 --> 44:03.360
I'm sorry.

44:22.520 --> 44:23.520
Nanno.

44:31.840 --> 44:33.640
She's so cute.

44:36.280 --> 44:39.640
Nanno. I'm sorry.

44:41.120 --> 44:42.800
I'll be a better man.

44:44.400 --> 44:45.400
Nanno,

44:46.720 --> 44:48.040
please come back and stay with me.

44:53.280 --> 44:56.240
No, I just came to visit.

44:59.320 --> 45:00.760
Here's a gift for you.

45:04.440 --> 45:05.520
Why?

45:06.680 --> 45:08.200
This is our child.

45:08.960 --> 45:12.360
I got to see you being a father, no…

45:12.440 --> 45:14.280
being a good mother like this.

45:14.360 --> 45:15.960
I feel relieved now.

45:16.920 --> 45:17.800
Nanno.

45:18.280 --> 45:20.720
Nanno, wait.

45:20.800 --> 45:22.600
Nanno, please stay with me--

45:43.400 --> 45:49.080
HAHAHAHAHAHAHA

48:14.800 --> 48:19.800
